1
00:00:00,006 --> 00:00:01,432
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,433 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,139 --> 00:00:04,139
(Episode 67)

4
00:00:04,164 --> 00:00:05,164
Really?

5
00:00:05,488 --> 00:00:06,488
Yeah.

6
00:00:06,686 --> 00:00:09,387
Every morning, I heard crashing sounds
and screams.

7
00:00:09,707 --> 00:00:11,707
I thought my heart was going to stop.

8
00:00:11,891 --> 00:00:15,292
Whenever I went to get some water,
my aunt would suddenly throw her glass.

9
00:00:15,606 --> 00:00:18,000
- No way.
- And when my mom saw her,

10
00:00:18,073 --> 00:00:19,615
she'd glare at my aunt.

11
00:00:20,052 --> 00:00:23,256
I thought I'd end up back in the hospital
before regaining my memory.

12
00:00:23,637 --> 00:00:26,522
Those two really went out of their way.

13
00:00:27,456 --> 00:00:30,031
In the end, your piano playing
brought my memories back.

14
00:00:31,741 --> 00:00:33,783
The sheet music you sent me.

15
00:00:34,067 --> 00:00:36,272
I played it a few times.
I liked the piece.

16
00:00:37,118 --> 00:00:41,081
You know how music can make you feel
like you're back in a certain moment?

17
00:00:42,192 --> 00:00:45,127
I guess the power of music
really worked a miracle.

18
00:00:45,848 --> 00:00:46,848
Just the music?

19
00:00:47,043 --> 00:00:48,400
Was it only the music you liked?

20
00:00:51,891 --> 00:00:54,623
I really don't want to say goodbye.

21
00:00:56,498 --> 00:00:58,783
Want to take one more lap
around the neighborhood?

22
00:01:00,751 --> 00:01:02,935
We've already gone around twice.

23
00:01:05,958 --> 00:01:06,958
Go on inside.

24
00:01:09,904 --> 00:01:12,229
I'll call you tonight.

25
00:01:13,421 --> 00:01:14,421
Why?

26
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:16,189
Do you have something to tell me?

27
00:01:16,349 --> 00:01:18,740
You really have no idea, do you?

28
00:01:19,078 --> 00:01:21,222
You call before bed and when you wake up.

29
00:01:21,298 --> 00:01:22,509
Those are the basics of dating.

30
00:01:22,534 --> 00:01:24,336
What...

31
00:01:24,693 --> 00:01:26,326
So you're speaking from experience?

32
00:01:26,505 --> 00:01:28,556
It's not from experience.

33
00:01:29,298 --> 00:01:30,552
Look it up.

34
00:01:30,577 --> 00:01:32,735
Or ask AI Jung A.

35
00:01:32,759 --> 00:01:34,115
AI Jung A?

36
00:01:35,924 --> 00:01:38,684
Fine. I'll call you today.

37
00:01:41,131 --> 00:01:42,530
What time should I call?

38
00:01:44,573 --> 00:01:45,670
Nine?

39
00:01:46,165 --> 00:01:47,165
Ten?

40
00:01:47,542 --> 00:01:48,542
Ten.

41
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:50,319
Sounds good.

42
00:01:51,728 --> 00:01:52,728
Go on inside.

43
00:02:30,998 --> 00:02:31,998
It's me.

44
00:02:32,042 --> 00:02:33,273
Yes, come in.

45
00:02:41,698 --> 00:02:43,202
Are you planning my wedding?

46
00:02:43,342 --> 00:02:44,924
What? Yes.

47
00:02:45,021 --> 00:02:46,021
Why?

48
00:02:46,092 --> 00:02:47,835
Is there something you don't like?

49
00:02:48,347 --> 00:02:50,212
Did I say I was going to marry Do Hee?

50
00:02:50,890 --> 00:02:52,128
Come on...

51
00:02:52,171 --> 00:02:54,281
You kept asking for Do Hee.

52
00:02:54,674 --> 00:02:56,067
You even said you'd marry her.

53
00:02:56,092 --> 00:02:58,140
That was when
I couldn't remember anything.

54
00:02:59,256 --> 00:03:00,256
What?

55
00:03:00,861 --> 00:03:02,016
I got my memory back.

56
00:03:02,899 --> 00:03:03,899
All of it.

57
00:03:04,229 --> 00:03:05,453
Ji Hu.

58
00:03:06,081 --> 00:03:07,508
When did you remember?

59
00:03:07,932 --> 00:03:10,212
- Hey, you remember everything?
- Yes.

60
00:03:10,891 --> 00:03:12,383
That makes me even angrier.

61
00:03:12,971 --> 00:03:14,051
At Do Hee,

62
00:03:14,975 --> 00:03:16,182
and at both of you.

63
00:03:18,751 --> 00:03:20,279
I can't marry her.

64
00:03:20,918 --> 00:03:24,121
She tried to run someone over
because she couldn't control her emotions.

65
00:03:25,445 --> 00:03:28,654
The day before the accident,
I made it clear to Do Hee.

66
00:03:29,185 --> 00:03:30,642
We were over.

67
00:03:31,084 --> 00:03:32,910
I'd chosen Ji Ni as the woman I love...

68
00:03:32,934 --> 00:03:34,311
- and told her to accept it.
- Ji Hu!

69
00:03:34,336 --> 00:03:35,815
And the very next day...

70
00:03:36,647 --> 00:03:38,198
was Ji Ni's birthday.

71
00:03:38,772 --> 00:03:40,815
Do Hee tried to run Ji Ni over,

72
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,435
and I got hit instead.

73
00:03:44,102 --> 00:03:47,440
But it's too late now.

74
00:03:47,892 --> 00:03:49,804
You kept asking for Do Hee.

75
00:03:49,828 --> 00:03:51,322
We didn't know what to do.

76
00:03:51,347 --> 00:03:52,347
But...

77
00:03:52,696 --> 00:03:55,405
there was no way to know
when you'd get your memory back, and...

78
00:03:55,430 --> 00:03:56,862
I understand, so...

79
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:59,364
please help me set things right.

80
00:03:59,388 --> 00:04:00,511
Does Do Hee know?

81
00:04:01,154 --> 00:04:02,374
I saw her this afternoon.

82
00:04:03,278 --> 00:04:04,889
We were already over,

83
00:04:04,913 --> 00:04:07,135
but she took things this far
just because I couldn't remember.

84
00:04:07,733 --> 00:04:09,557
- I'm furious.
- This afternoon?

85
00:04:11,310 --> 00:04:13,612
She just dropped this off.

86
00:04:13,976 --> 00:04:16,596
- What's that?
- A marriage certificate.

87
00:04:19,338 --> 00:04:20,929
A marriage certificate?

88
00:04:23,010 --> 00:04:24,600
Do Do Hee really knows no bounds...

89
00:04:25,878 --> 00:04:26,878
Dad,

90
00:04:27,111 --> 00:04:29,004
I'll never forgive Do Hee.

91
00:04:29,096 --> 00:04:31,037
How can she keep doing whatever she wants?

92
00:04:32,409 --> 00:04:33,704
Ji Hu.

93
00:04:33,972 --> 00:04:35,648
Didn't you agree to it?

94
00:04:35,811 --> 00:04:39,101
She would've needed your ID and seal.
Didn't you give them to her?

95
00:04:39,126 --> 00:04:40,145
No.

96
00:04:40,391 --> 00:04:43,608
She mentioned registering our marriage,
and I clearly told her to stop.

97
00:04:43,632 --> 00:04:44,766
When I met her this afternoon,

98
00:04:45,614 --> 00:04:47,840
I was going to tell her
I'd regained my memory.

99
00:04:48,492 --> 00:04:49,849
I see.

100
00:04:50,871 --> 00:04:53,100
I'm surprised you've regained your memory,

101
00:04:53,698 --> 00:04:56,704
and I'm still trying
to process everything.

102
00:04:57,278 --> 00:04:58,573
Leave us for a moment.

103
00:05:02,125 --> 00:05:03,798
I can't believe this.

104
00:05:19,606 --> 00:05:20,877
How did it go?

105
00:05:21,859 --> 00:05:23,127
I told them everything.

106
00:05:24,118 --> 00:05:26,100
They wanted to discuss it, so I left.

107
00:05:27,385 --> 00:05:28,662
My head's pounding too.

108
00:05:28,735 --> 00:05:31,743
You've been stressing too much.
You're not fully recovered yet.

109
00:05:34,332 --> 00:05:35,570
But, Aunt...

110
00:05:39,332 --> 00:05:40,850
(Marriage Certificate)

111
00:05:41,527 --> 00:05:42,943
What's this?

112
00:05:43,932 --> 00:05:45,821
What do we do about this?

113
00:05:45,981 --> 00:05:47,052
Exactly.

114
00:05:49,318 --> 00:05:51,086
My head is killing me.

115
00:05:52,910 --> 00:05:54,734
Shouldn't you see a doctor?

116
00:05:56,705 --> 00:05:57,946
I'm going to lie down.

117
00:05:58,692 --> 00:05:59,692
Okay.

118
00:06:13,465 --> 00:06:15,406
At least it's good
you've got your memory back.

119
00:06:15,852 --> 00:06:17,582
It's certainly cause
for celebration, but...

120
00:06:17,606 --> 00:06:21,137
before we can even be happy,
another problem comes up. It's upsetting.

121
00:06:22,387 --> 00:06:23,428
I'm sorry.

122
00:06:24,372 --> 00:06:26,202
I discussed it with your mom,

123
00:06:26,451 --> 00:06:27,991
but there's nothing we can change.

124
00:06:28,245 --> 00:06:30,544
You were the one
who wanted to rush the wedding.

125
00:06:31,156 --> 00:06:34,012
I wanted to wait
until your memory came back.

126
00:06:34,165 --> 00:06:35,402
- Back then...
- That was then.

127
00:06:35,427 --> 00:06:37,049
Don't go back on it now.

128
00:06:37,179 --> 00:06:38,439
Marriage is a major life decision.

129
00:06:38,729 --> 00:06:41,609
You were practically engaged to Do Hee
from the start,

130
00:06:41,633 --> 00:06:43,154
and both families had agreed to it.

131
00:06:43,179 --> 00:06:44,841
Then you met Ji Ni from work,

132
00:06:44,866 --> 00:06:46,322
tried to call it off, and had an accident.

133
00:06:47,447 --> 00:06:49,600
You can't change your mind all over again.

134
00:06:50,014 --> 00:06:51,980
It wouldn't be fair to Do Hee
or her parents.

135
00:06:52,010 --> 00:06:53,450
You can't do that to them.

136
00:06:53,532 --> 00:06:56,192
Luckily, the paperwork is already done,

137
00:06:56,993 --> 00:06:57,993
so forget about Ji Ni.

138
00:06:58,018 --> 00:06:59,079
Dad!

139
00:06:59,266 --> 00:07:01,079
Those documents
were obtained fraudulently!

140
00:07:01,185 --> 00:07:04,102
You're defending her for taking my ID
and doing this without my consent?

141
00:07:04,932 --> 00:07:07,727
You and Ji Ni aren't meant to be.
That's why this happened.

142
00:07:09,258 --> 00:07:12,185
I know you and Ji Ni share
an artistic connection.

143
00:07:12,485 --> 00:07:14,590
But that's different from marriage.

144
00:07:15,464 --> 00:07:18,417
Just because you're artistic soulmates
doesn't mean you have to marry.

145
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:20,823
What are you even saying?

146
00:07:21,052 --> 00:07:22,539
Stop talking nonsense.

147
00:07:22,964 --> 00:07:24,797
You saw the dashcam footage.
You know the truth!

148
00:07:24,822 --> 00:07:26,817
You know who I'd risk my life for!

149
00:07:27,205 --> 00:07:29,110
You should've protected me.

150
00:07:29,195 --> 00:07:31,195
- That's what parents do!
- Im Ji Hu!

151
00:07:31,220 --> 00:07:33,423
Why are you so set on this marriage?

152
00:07:33,570 --> 00:07:34,881
What's so great about Do Hee's family?

153
00:07:35,169 --> 00:07:37,334
You're selling me off to a murderer!

154
00:07:37,358 --> 00:07:38,544
You little punk!

155
00:07:40,032 --> 00:07:43,462
You think I'm a greedy father
who puts money before his own son?

156
00:07:44,092 --> 00:07:45,598
In front of Ambassador Do,

157
00:07:45,622 --> 00:07:47,817
I swallowed my pride to protect you!

158
00:07:47,916 --> 00:07:49,392
Do you know nothing about your own dad?

159
00:07:53,138 --> 00:07:54,498
No. I don't.

160
00:07:55,901 --> 00:07:57,948
Mom can't stand Ji Ni's background,

161
00:07:59,006 --> 00:08:01,360
but she's obsessed with Do Hee
and her wealth.

162
00:08:02,007 --> 00:08:03,512
And you're just trying to protect...

163
00:08:04,599 --> 00:08:06,004
mom's pride and your own reputation.

164
00:08:07,396 --> 00:08:08,910
You really have no filter.

165
00:08:09,252 --> 00:08:11,400
Whether you've regained
your memory or not,

166
00:08:12,025 --> 00:08:13,900
- our decision stands!
- No.

167
00:08:14,772 --> 00:08:18,015
Now that I know the truth,
I will never marry her.

168
00:08:19,132 --> 00:08:20,438
Those papers are fraudulent.

169
00:08:20,952 --> 00:08:22,801
I'll find a way to undo this.

170
00:08:38,737 --> 00:08:40,244
(Marriage Certificate)

171
00:08:49,245 --> 00:08:50,489
Where are you going so late?

172
00:08:50,533 --> 00:08:51,681
I'll be back soon.

173
00:08:52,711 --> 00:08:54,414
Where are you going?

174
00:09:02,851 --> 00:09:04,896
She secretly took Ji Hu's ID...

175
00:09:05,015 --> 00:09:06,671
and registered their marriage.

176
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:09,775
- What?
- She said Joong Bin told her to do it.

177
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:12,315
I think he even hit Ji Hu earlier.

178
00:09:12,339 --> 00:09:13,339
Hit him?

179
00:09:14,145 --> 00:09:15,301
Joong Bin hit Ji Hu?

180
00:09:15,326 --> 00:09:17,839
Ji Hu is deeply hurt.

181
00:09:18,012 --> 00:09:20,006
They didn't help him when he had amnesia.

182
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:21,633
They pushed him toward Do Hee instead.

183
00:09:21,705 --> 00:09:22,981
And the whole reason...

184
00:09:23,005 --> 00:09:24,883
is Ji Ni's background.

185
00:09:25,032 --> 00:09:26,481
Because of me and Ji Ni...

186
00:09:33,439 --> 00:09:34,439
Sa Bin!

187
00:09:52,338 --> 00:09:53,338
Joong Bin.

188
00:09:54,027 --> 00:09:55,101
I'm disappointed in you.

189
00:09:56,233 --> 00:09:57,245
How could you do this?

190
00:09:57,270 --> 00:09:59,720
You don't have kids. Keep your mouth shut.
What do you know?

191
00:09:59,745 --> 00:10:00,800
Why wouldn't I know?

192
00:10:01,864 --> 00:10:04,089
Ji Hu loves Ji Ni, and Ji Ni loves Ji Hu.

193
00:10:04,091 --> 00:10:05,223
And Do Hee's the bad one.

194
00:10:05,711 --> 00:10:07,886
You're the ones who can't see
something so simple.

195
00:10:07,932 --> 00:10:09,542
Why are you getting involved?

196
00:10:10,119 --> 00:10:11,895
You think I'm pushing this marriage
for myself?

197
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,921
Then who are you doing it for?

198
00:10:14,484 --> 00:10:16,054
Do Hee? Sun Kyung?

199
00:10:17,001 --> 00:10:18,767
You should be putting Ji Hu first.

200
00:10:18,993 --> 00:10:21,233
You opposed my marriage
and now you're opposing Ji Hu's.

201
00:10:21,529 --> 00:10:23,900
You've changed.
You're becoming just like Sun Kyung.

202
00:10:23,925 --> 00:10:25,194
- You're acting strange lately.
- Sa Bin!

203
00:10:25,219 --> 00:10:26,944
You've seen how Yeong Ju is.

204
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,850
She's a good person.

205
00:10:28,981 --> 00:10:30,981
Ji Ni's the same. She's so kind-hearted.

206
00:10:31,006 --> 00:10:32,821
She's polite and has good values.

207
00:10:33,512 --> 00:10:37,054
It breaks my heart to see her living
under the weight of society's prejudice.

208
00:10:37,190 --> 00:10:40,007
I'm so proud Ji Hu sees her
for who she really is.

209
00:10:40,032 --> 00:10:43,189
I thought, "That's my nephew.
That's my brother's son."

210
00:10:44,731 --> 00:10:46,210
Are we the only people in the world?

211
00:10:46,272 --> 00:10:47,689
Is this house the whole world?

212
00:10:48,331 --> 00:10:50,996
You only live in your little clinic.
That's why you say things like that.

213
00:10:51,231 --> 00:10:52,935
I've experienced the real world.

214
00:10:53,008 --> 00:10:54,363
In a society obsessed with status,

215
00:10:54,387 --> 00:10:56,558
people judge your wife's family
and your own abilities.

216
00:10:56,747 --> 00:10:59,207
Even losing our parents at a young age
counts against us.

217
00:10:59,232 --> 00:11:01,067
Did we ask our parents to die young?

218
00:11:01,692 --> 00:11:03,316
The world will take advantage of you
if you let your guard down.

219
00:11:03,341 --> 00:11:05,760
Joong Bin, when Ji Hu was unconscious,

220
00:11:06,012 --> 00:11:08,022
weren't you just praying he'd wake up?

221
00:11:08,285 --> 00:11:10,915
Now he's back, healthy and safe.
What more do you want?

222
00:11:17,772 --> 00:11:19,755
Joong Bin, what did you tell me
when you left the military?

223
00:11:19,771 --> 00:11:22,450
You said we should stop chasing the top
and just be happy.

224
00:11:22,754 --> 00:11:25,481
You said running a publishing house
let you read whatever you wanted.

225
00:11:25,506 --> 00:11:27,252
Why are you such a hypocrite?

226
00:11:27,277 --> 00:11:29,283
I'm the only one who can settle for less.
Not Ji Hu.

227
00:11:29,432 --> 00:11:31,271
Ji Hu has to reach the top.
Why shouldn't he?

228
00:11:31,932 --> 00:11:33,671
I'll make sure nothing stands in his way.

229
00:11:35,892 --> 00:11:37,531
So this is how you really feel.

230
00:11:39,324 --> 00:11:40,324
Get out.

231
00:11:44,398 --> 00:11:45,783
Why are you smoking again? You just quit.

232
00:11:45,807 --> 00:11:47,036
Is smoking getting married?

233
00:12:01,378 --> 00:12:02,378
Yeah.

234
00:12:02,689 --> 00:12:04,390
You saw the digital wedding invitation?

235
00:12:05,085 --> 00:12:07,665
I should've handed it to you in person.

236
00:12:09,361 --> 00:12:10,595
Yeah, sure.

237
00:12:10,785 --> 00:12:11,785
Okay.

238
00:12:33,625 --> 00:12:34,885
Do Do Hee, open the door!

239
00:12:48,078 --> 00:12:49,315
Ji Hu, you're here?

240
00:12:49,838 --> 00:12:50,928
What do you think?

241
00:12:52,399 --> 00:12:53,615
Is it too short?

242
00:12:57,458 --> 00:12:58,740
You!

243
00:13:00,704 --> 00:13:01,898
Are you a psychopath?

244
00:13:02,295 --> 00:13:04,365
How can you smile
after making someone's life miserable?

245
00:13:05,443 --> 00:13:06,919
You're really angry, aren't you?

246
00:13:08,107 --> 00:13:09,107
Okay.

247
00:13:09,571 --> 00:13:10,692
Break everything.

248
00:13:11,950 --> 00:13:14,448
If it'll make you feel better,
go ahead. Let it all out.

249
00:13:21,111 --> 00:13:22,450
What on earth is wrong with you?

250
00:13:23,077 --> 00:13:25,535
How can anyone be this shameless?

251
00:13:25,892 --> 00:13:27,707
You steal, you lie,

252
00:13:27,731 --> 00:13:29,443
and when that doesn't work,
you use violence.

253
00:13:30,099 --> 00:13:31,687
Is this what you call love?

254
00:13:31,783 --> 00:13:32,783
Yeah.

255
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,158
It's love.

256
00:13:35,124 --> 00:13:37,175
Love doesn't come
just because you ask nicely.

257
00:13:38,178 --> 00:13:40,796
I'll go get you, break you down,
and keep you by my side.

258
00:13:41,831 --> 00:13:43,240
I don't care if I can't have you.

259
00:13:43,872 --> 00:13:45,308
As long as Ji Ni can't have you.

260
00:13:45,999 --> 00:13:46,999
Love?

261
00:13:49,078 --> 00:13:50,702
I don't even know...

262
00:13:50,876 --> 00:13:52,521
- what love is anymore.
- Do Do Hee!

263
00:13:52,546 --> 00:13:53,546
Ji Hu.

264
00:13:53,896 --> 00:13:55,819
I only have one goal left now.

265
00:13:56,444 --> 00:13:57,731
To make Ji Ni miserable.

266
00:13:58,158 --> 00:14:00,055
Even if I have to give up
my own happiness,

267
00:14:00,419 --> 00:14:02,419
I won't let you two be happy together.

268
00:14:03,919 --> 00:14:05,253
I won't stand for that.

269
00:14:09,285 --> 00:14:10,285
Hit me.

270
00:14:11,061 --> 00:14:12,378
I'm used to getting hit.

271
00:14:15,972 --> 00:14:17,481
Cancel the marriage registration.

272
00:14:18,358 --> 00:14:19,632
Or get a divorce.

273
00:14:19,772 --> 00:14:21,823
Undo this stupid paperwork...

274
00:14:22,560 --> 00:14:23,560
you filed on your own.

275
00:14:26,297 --> 00:14:27,297
No.

276
00:14:30,283 --> 00:14:32,124
Now Ji Ni's the mistress,

277
00:14:32,246 --> 00:14:33,415
just like her mom.

278
00:14:35,532 --> 00:14:36,719
I love it.

279
00:14:44,226 --> 00:14:46,390
When you lost your memory, even briefly,

280
00:14:47,009 --> 00:14:50,636
I was so happy that you were mine.

281
00:14:52,372 --> 00:14:53,965
I'll live on that memory,

282
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,813
making her miserable.

283
00:14:58,103 --> 00:15:00,012
Do Hee, please.

284
00:15:01,938 --> 00:15:03,380
Should I get down on my knees?

285
00:15:04,032 --> 00:15:06,317
What will it take for us to break up?

286
00:15:07,339 --> 00:15:08,707
Just live with it.

287
00:15:09,698 --> 00:15:11,874
I'll be your official wife,
and Ji Ni can be your mistress.

288
00:15:12,792 --> 00:15:15,424
I'm fine with that. I don't care.

289
00:15:17,952 --> 00:15:20,382
Once she finds out,
she'll leave on her own.

290
00:15:21,032 --> 00:15:23,746
She can't handle this. You know that.

291
00:15:23,964 --> 00:15:25,226
You're crazy.

292
00:15:25,686 --> 00:15:27,090
You're really crazy!

293
00:15:31,631 --> 00:15:33,774
Kill me,

294
00:15:34,215 --> 00:15:36,519
then you'll be free.

295
00:15:38,885 --> 00:15:40,972
Even if I die,
I'll still be your official wife.

296
00:15:41,965 --> 00:15:45,278
She will never take my place.

297
00:15:52,591 --> 00:15:53,591
Ji Hu!

298
00:15:54,445 --> 00:15:55,445
Ji Hu!

299
00:15:56,404 --> 00:15:57,735
Shut up!

300
00:16:01,426 --> 00:16:03,159
Are you out of your mind?

301
00:16:03,279 --> 00:16:04,759
You're not the only one with leverage.

302
00:16:06,158 --> 00:16:08,667
If the dad you rely on so much
decides to abandon you,

303
00:16:09,647 --> 00:16:10,869
what will you do then?

304
00:16:11,825 --> 00:16:13,144
Don't bring my dad into this.

305
00:16:13,198 --> 00:16:14,988
If I turn against my own dad,

306
00:16:15,735 --> 00:16:17,755
and if I expose your fake credentials!

307
00:16:21,331 --> 00:16:22,384
Better yet,

308
00:16:23,022 --> 00:16:24,744
I should post it on social media, right?

309
00:16:26,131 --> 00:16:27,232
Are you going to leave me, then?

310
00:16:30,144 --> 00:16:31,712
You can't do that, Ji Hu.

311
00:16:33,945 --> 00:16:35,815
You can't do that to me.

312
00:16:56,378 --> 00:17:02,338
What is it about Ji Ni
that makes you go this far?

313
00:17:27,193 --> 00:17:28,607
(Do Do Hee)

314
00:17:42,191 --> 00:17:43,531
Hey, you crazy bitch.

315
00:17:43,778 --> 00:17:46,035
If you answer, say something.

316
00:17:46,265 --> 00:17:47,419
You're the one who called.

317
00:17:48,558 --> 00:17:50,298
Why are you always throwing
your weight around?

318
00:17:50,725 --> 00:17:52,712
When I tell you to get lost,
just get lost.

319
00:17:52,865 --> 00:17:54,092
Know your place.

320
00:17:54,118 --> 00:17:55,400
And what's my place?

321
00:17:55,944 --> 00:17:58,583
I told you.
There's no difference between us.

322
00:17:58,725 --> 00:18:00,017
How are we the same?

323
00:18:00,925 --> 00:18:04,081
Ji Hu and I are legally married.
You're not.

324
00:18:04,942 --> 00:18:05,942
Are you laughing?

325
00:18:06,564 --> 00:18:08,687
- Did you just laugh?
- You're ridiculous.

326
00:18:09,712 --> 00:18:13,258
I registered my marriage with Ji Hu.

327
00:18:14,919 --> 00:18:17,818
- What?
- His parents approved too.

328
00:18:19,176 --> 00:18:22,678
Even if he gets his memory back now,
it's too late.

329
00:18:23,498 --> 00:18:24,908
Check for yourself
if you don't believe me.

330
00:18:25,345 --> 00:18:28,819
And stay away from him.

331
00:18:28,968 --> 00:18:30,727
You filthy homewrecker.

332
00:18:32,069 --> 00:18:33,156
Do Do Hee.

333
00:18:34,465 --> 00:18:36,323
Have you come to your senses yet,

334
00:18:36,392 --> 00:18:37,585
you stupid bitch?

335
00:18:38,398 --> 00:18:41,476
Now I can legally
drag you around by the hair.

336
00:18:42,052 --> 00:18:44,169
That's my right as his official wife.

337
00:18:44,632 --> 00:18:46,873
Just like his aunt did to your mom.

338
00:18:47,611 --> 00:18:48,611
Hey.

339
00:18:48,783 --> 00:18:52,022
His aunt was so good at acting nice.
What a hypocrite!

340
00:18:52,338 --> 00:18:53,524
She's a sly old fox.

341
00:18:53,578 --> 00:18:54,981
Watch your mouth.

342
00:18:55,904 --> 00:18:57,479
Whatever you say.

343
00:18:58,405 --> 00:19:00,364
Anyway, now that you know your place,

344
00:19:00,365 --> 00:19:02,883
crawl back into your hole.

345
00:19:02,885 --> 00:19:05,996
Your luck will never change. Got it?

346
00:19:07,038 --> 00:19:08,994
I'll kill you if I see you again.

347
00:19:23,679 --> 00:19:24,902
(Ji Hu)

348
00:19:28,698 --> 00:19:32,798
The person you're calling is unavailable.
Please leave a message after the beep.

349
00:19:48,542 --> 00:19:49,674
Ji Hu.

350
00:19:50,305 --> 00:19:52,073
Why aren't you answering my calls?

351
00:19:52,539 --> 00:19:53,867
What are you doing here?

352
00:19:54,665 --> 00:19:55,756
Ji Ni.

353
00:19:59,785 --> 00:20:02,431
Do Do Hee just called me...

354
00:20:09,591 --> 00:20:10,879
Let me explain.

355
00:20:13,445 --> 00:20:14,737
I'll take care of everything.

356
00:20:17,198 --> 00:20:18,867
So please don't leave me.

357
00:20:20,595 --> 00:20:21,954
Don't let it get you down.

358
00:20:28,678 --> 00:20:30,029
I'm sorry, Ji Ni.

359
00:20:33,591 --> 00:20:34,862
This is so hard.

360
00:20:37,705 --> 00:20:39,867
I don't know what to do about this.

361
00:20:43,621 --> 00:20:45,006
Don't cry.

362
00:20:46,131 --> 00:20:48,552
They say there's always a way,
even when all seems lost.

363
00:20:52,951 --> 00:20:54,627
What happened to your hand?

364
00:20:55,752 --> 00:20:57,087
It's nothing.

365
00:20:59,025 --> 00:21:00,858
I'm just so upset,

366
00:21:02,905 --> 00:21:04,137
and I regret everything.

367
00:21:09,645 --> 00:21:12,043
When I gave up piano and went to England,

368
00:21:13,503 --> 00:21:15,094
I had no hope at all.

369
00:21:16,105 --> 00:21:18,764
But I wanted to repay
the parents who raised me.

370
00:21:21,805 --> 00:21:24,144
My mom happened to like Do Hee,
so I met her.

371
00:21:25,223 --> 00:21:27,179
I never thought...

372
00:21:29,705 --> 00:21:31,685
that throwing my life away like that...

373
00:21:33,321 --> 00:21:34,887
would end up hurting you.

374
00:21:37,225 --> 00:21:38,367
It's okay.

375
00:21:39,567 --> 00:21:42,602
We didn't know each other back then.

376
00:21:46,332 --> 00:21:47,456
So,

377
00:21:48,482 --> 00:21:50,733
are you really legally married?

378
00:21:54,818 --> 00:21:56,171
I'm really sorry.

379
00:21:58,938 --> 00:22:01,402
I never should've dragged you into this.

380
00:22:11,067 --> 00:22:13,119
Let's go to the studio first.

381
00:22:13,912 --> 00:22:16,329
It'll be worse if we run into my mom here.

382
00:22:17,392 --> 00:22:19,860
Let's go there and figure things out.

383
00:22:26,271 --> 00:22:27,565
That's sharp.

384
00:22:30,245 --> 00:22:32,719
A little more.

385
00:22:38,598 --> 00:22:39,831
You scared me!

386
00:22:40,081 --> 00:22:41,183
Sit down over there.

387
00:22:41,185 --> 00:22:42,185
What's going on this late?

388
00:22:43,569 --> 00:22:44,662
Did you get into a fight?

389
00:22:46,111 --> 00:22:48,250
How did you get so banged up?

390
00:22:48,626 --> 00:22:49,952
Where did you get hurt?

391
00:22:50,421 --> 00:22:52,064
That must hurt.

392
00:22:52,244 --> 00:22:54,191
- What do we do?
- Hold on.

393
00:23:03,018 --> 00:23:05,885
What? Hold on.

394
00:23:06,912 --> 00:23:08,898
Do Hee registered the marriage?

395
00:23:13,725 --> 00:23:15,354
There has to be a way to fix this.

396
00:23:17,425 --> 00:23:20,456
You can get a divorce
if the other person is at fault,

397
00:23:20,844 --> 00:23:22,830
or if you both agree to it.

398
00:23:22,854 --> 00:23:24,304
I know Do Hee's weakness.

399
00:23:24,992 --> 00:23:26,687
I'll find a way to get divorced.

400
00:23:28,672 --> 00:23:30,085
Getting divorced
when we were never even married!

401
00:23:31,171 --> 00:23:32,171
Wait.

402
00:23:32,887 --> 00:23:34,923
You don't need a divorce.

403
00:23:35,183 --> 00:23:36,362
What do you mean?

404
00:23:37,145 --> 00:23:39,189
Do Hee went and did it on her own, right?

405
00:23:39,752 --> 00:23:40,905
That's fraud.

406
00:23:40,938 --> 00:23:43,767
She forged the paperwork.
You can file for an annulment.

407
00:23:44,858 --> 00:23:48,241
Ji Hu, you told her
you wouldn't agree to it, right?

408
00:23:48,351 --> 00:23:50,174
- She did it on her own, right?
- Of course.

409
00:23:50,205 --> 00:23:51,705
She even stole my ID.

410
00:23:53,131 --> 00:23:55,247
A marriage annulment?
Are you sure that'll work?

411
00:23:55,936 --> 00:23:57,130
We need to look into it right away.

412
00:24:02,078 --> 00:24:03,524
She registered the marriage?

413
00:24:04,168 --> 00:24:05,716
Really?

414
00:24:05,918 --> 00:24:07,916
I came to check on Ji Ni.

415
00:24:07,918 --> 00:24:09,516
She must've been so shocked.

416
00:24:12,158 --> 00:24:14,743
Do Hee is unbelievable.

417
00:24:14,976 --> 00:24:15,976
Good for Do Hee.

418
00:24:15,992 --> 00:24:18,243
Good for her!

419
00:24:19,334 --> 00:24:21,582
- Are you crazy?
- No.

420
00:24:21,732 --> 00:24:23,055
Seung Woo's right.

421
00:24:23,237 --> 00:24:25,387
Good for her. She did great.

422
00:24:25,388 --> 00:24:27,271
- Se Ri.
- It's over now.

423
00:24:27,618 --> 00:24:29,970
I was worried they'd drag this out,

424
00:24:30,104 --> 00:24:31,639
but now that it's official, it's over.

425
00:24:31,992 --> 00:24:36,320
Ji Hu's a married man now. Do you think
Ji Ni would ever go after a married man?

426
00:24:36,432 --> 00:24:38,801
She can't stand the idea
of being the mistress.

427
00:24:39,136 --> 00:24:41,232
She'll give up now. This is great.

428
00:24:41,234 --> 00:24:42,817
That's not the point.

429
00:24:43,051 --> 00:24:45,011
Do Hee did it without his consent.

430
00:24:45,598 --> 00:24:48,430
He's going to file for an annulment.

431
00:24:48,585 --> 00:24:49,990
And Ji Ni feels the same way.

432
00:24:49,992 --> 00:24:53,293
So don't treat her badly...

433
00:24:53,294 --> 00:24:55,379
and be careful not to hurt her feelings.

434
00:24:56,096 --> 00:24:57,096
What?

435
00:24:57,465 --> 00:25:01,481
She knows all this
and is still seeing him?

436
00:25:03,305 --> 00:25:04,523
No way.

437
00:25:04,945 --> 00:25:07,298
That girl has lost her mind!

438
00:25:07,585 --> 00:25:10,671
Legal documents are serious business.
How can she be so reckless?

439
00:25:13,180 --> 00:25:15,173
- Are you okay?
- Yeah.

440
00:25:15,658 --> 00:25:19,446
So what did his family say?

441
00:25:19,872 --> 00:25:23,069
They said they'd go ahead with it
and that the paperwork was all set.

442
00:25:23,625 --> 00:25:24,625
What?

443
00:25:28,306 --> 00:25:29,598
Se Ri.

444
00:25:30,386 --> 00:25:31,556
Hold on.

445
00:25:31,558 --> 00:25:32,685
So,

446
00:25:33,430 --> 00:25:36,533
Ji Ni's in love with Ji Hu,

447
00:25:36,791 --> 00:25:39,510
even though he's legally married?

448
00:25:40,353 --> 00:25:43,242
She's not giving up
even after the paperwork went through?

449
00:25:43,244 --> 00:25:44,700
Well, it's just that...

450
00:25:45,579 --> 00:25:49,252
Do Hee stole Ji Hu's ID.

451
00:25:51,479 --> 00:25:52,923
Se Ri!

452
00:26:05,158 --> 00:26:06,812
- The food here is great.
- Yeah.

453
00:26:09,138 --> 00:26:10,138
Im Ji Hu!

454
00:26:10,172 --> 00:26:11,172
- Mother.
- You bastard!

455
00:26:11,210 --> 00:26:12,589
You rotten jerk!

456
00:26:12,685 --> 00:26:15,418
How could you do this to Ji Ni?

457
00:26:15,931 --> 00:26:18,542
You think you can take advantage of us
just because it's only my daughter and me?

458
00:26:18,543 --> 00:26:21,289
- You rotten jerk!
- Mother.

459
00:26:21,403 --> 00:26:22,749
Mother?

460
00:26:22,751 --> 00:26:24,829
- Mother.
- Don't you "Mother" me!

461
00:26:24,831 --> 00:26:27,292
- Please, let's talk this out.
- You little punk!

462
00:26:27,312 --> 00:26:28,312
Let go!

463
00:26:29,931 --> 00:26:31,225
This can't be happening.

464
00:26:31,925 --> 00:26:34,084
This can't be happening!

465
00:26:41,625 --> 00:26:42,700
I'm sorry.

466
00:26:44,292 --> 00:26:46,025
But I'll make things right soon.

467
00:26:46,852 --> 00:26:48,208
I'll take legal action...

468
00:26:48,671 --> 00:26:50,375
and clear up the paperwork.

469
00:26:50,838 --> 00:26:52,534
I'll make sure Ji Ni's name is cleared.

470
00:26:52,582 --> 00:26:54,892
I don't believe you. I can't trust you.

471
00:26:55,607 --> 00:26:59,277
Finish this, then leave with Do Hee.

472
00:26:59,390 --> 00:27:01,477
Please. I'm begging you.

473
00:27:02,305 --> 00:27:03,500
I can't do that.

474
00:27:04,832 --> 00:27:07,694
This is the first time
I've ever wanted to live this much.

475
00:27:08,295 --> 00:27:10,196
I've never wanted anything so badly.

476
00:27:11,151 --> 00:27:12,671
You think you're the only one?

477
00:27:13,245 --> 00:27:16,552
Every love feels like a first love.
Now get lost.

478
00:27:16,678 --> 00:27:19,371
Stay away from Ji Ni.

479
00:27:19,665 --> 00:27:21,375
I'll never approve of this.

480
00:27:21,809 --> 00:27:22,809
Mother.

481
00:27:24,933 --> 00:27:26,011
Mother,

482
00:27:27,189 --> 00:27:28,917
please give us your blessing.

483
00:27:29,820 --> 00:27:30,992
I'll treat her right.

484
00:27:31,956 --> 00:27:33,131
You can trust him.

485
00:27:33,132 --> 00:27:36,419
We all know how much Ji Ni
and Ji Hu love each other.

486
00:27:38,473 --> 00:27:39,835
Please, Mother.

487
00:27:40,671 --> 00:27:42,804
Just give us one chance. Please?

488
00:27:42,945 --> 00:27:44,262
Absolutely not.

489
00:27:44,665 --> 00:27:46,008
I can't put Ji Ni...

490
00:27:46,135 --> 00:27:48,392
between you and Do Hee.

491
00:27:49,133 --> 00:27:50,133
Give up.

492
00:27:54,163 --> 00:27:55,283
Ji Hu.

493
00:28:05,391 --> 00:28:06,391
Ji Hu.

494
00:28:07,283 --> 00:28:08,312
What are you doing?

495
00:28:08,811 --> 00:28:11,612
Why are you kneeling at that woman's feet?

496
00:28:12,164 --> 00:28:13,323
Why?

497
00:28:15,465 --> 00:28:16,550
Ji Hu.

498
00:28:21,545 --> 00:28:22,931
Ji Hu!

499
00:28:25,038 --> 00:28:26,667
Ji Hu!

500
00:28:46,615 --> 00:28:49,961
(Family Register)

501
00:28:49,963 --> 00:28:51,612
Why are you doing this?
You said you loved me!

502
00:28:51,614 --> 00:28:52,912
Enough. Just stop.

503
00:28:52,914 --> 00:28:54,398
So Na Ji Ni is a monster to you.

504
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:55,889
- Do Hee was right.
- Really?

505
00:28:55,891 --> 00:28:57,972
You're furious? Imagine how I felt.
Brace yourself.

506
00:28:57,973 --> 00:29:00,296
- I'll see this through to the end.
- Let Ji Hu go.

507
00:29:00,297 --> 00:29:01,751
You can't handle this.

508
00:29:01,865 --> 00:29:04,483
I can already see you
crying your eyes out.

509
00:29:04,544 --> 00:29:07,070
Ji Hu's going to marry you,
no matter what.

510
00:29:07,146 --> 00:29:09,132
Then I'll move in here and live with you.

511
00:29:11,166 --> 00:29:13,166
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
